{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30011_01_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:33d8ad146a2370b15753a62d200eacfe8e29d224262d329798f9d48da2f9d2bf",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_f:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_f:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aee2a9f3999ceb4689fde4dfc22f1a0b95d17f7057dc5385b00f6646ca582fa7",
      "text": "（商讨的结果，定为由桐生先生负责折扇，九郎先生\n负责茶具，翔真先生负责和服的讲解！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cec474810dd0481ad4dc35fa2c1f8cf6e5da615e10fc02aa70448b97667a5dd",
      "text": "……然后呢，茶具的分类主要有两种最出名的。\n不过既然你本身也是茶道老师，就不需要我多加解释了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20341f0be8d7d36d963f0f4d3061ac39c30c419fffdbeefb51033087e07c4d8b",
      "text": "哪里的话。窑口师傅的讲解字字珠玑，令在下受益匪浅。\n不知可否劳烦您继续赐教？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_f:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c189d36c552c954504800d754d54ac713c924f0734c1996364748815865b74e9",
      "text": "（九郎君的眼睛都在闪闪发光喵。\n一提到茶道的事果然就完全不一样了喵）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6b52846a6114ca39b93610d8f278482717237fa87f5cc80b6bf0bd24d375bfb",
      "text": "（再瞧瞧看，蝴蝶先生那边……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_f:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9339d966210d2c453d3bc34f56b6fbfc0cefa888aa654e260dc05042b182b042",
      "text": "毕竟我们想写一份带有彩这支队伍风格的台本\n呢。还可以多向您请教一些其他细节吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_f:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b7966cb038f5677d25756aa233e3033cf1caff9817b428e9fbd428a00f37acb",
      "text": "哎，当然可以！有什么想问的尽管问！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_f:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1d5ad8a224bfcbcf8910027e68b51ec91d1edec03fb9d0b43dec2a1d62e1bad",
      "text": "（哦！看起来完全打成一片了喵）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_f:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5326e64f8db77a343e51c1bd287c36c93571da89a5872045bc341711b3ee809c",
      "text": "（哎呀呀，咱可不能闲着喵！\n在下也得多听听关于折扇的事才行）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
